<title>POLAND: SWARZEDZ DECREASES LOSS IN MAY.</title>
<headline>SWARZEDZ DECREASES LOSS IN MAY.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY			1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.94 vs   1.88</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.94 vs   2.05</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.23 vs   1.03 loss</p>
<p> Sales		   12.26 vs   5.83</p>
<p> JANUARY-MAY	    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 1.54 vs   1.72</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   1.54 vs   1.72</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.19 vs   3.70</p>
<p> Sales		   53.06 vs  41.08</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish furniture maker is Swarzedzkie</p>
<p>Fabryki Mebli Swarzedz SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
